{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年38歲、曾於TVB處境劇《依家有喜》飾演診所接待員「蘇哥莉（Cally）」的范彩兒正式拉埋天窗！其實Jenny早於今年8月已在社交平台出Po放閃，分享兩人去旅行的合照並冧爆稱呼另一半為「老公」。日前她正式補擺喜酒，圈中好友如潘嘉德、菁瑋及《愛·回家》「二太」蘇恩磁均有到場祝賀。</p><figure><img alt=\"范彩兒係前TVB藝人。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994133362970624473986.jpeg/44sek4cgI7iEvR2WN3lCetzDOWleMx3Jvc86JL3POiQ\"/><figcaption>范彩兒係前TVB藝人。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"社交平台經常晒火辣身材。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994137922441216503978.png/6UeXV7VJsiQuFEKL1EFKgN47CpbPjr9KTNZPskzWT7I\"/><figcaption>社交平台經常晒火辣身材。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"恭喜！（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994514679992320243057.png/uKeCfehpYNlxL4oV4U5O3xyYVdm_h4d0eOzJPnjsyT4\"/><figcaption>恭喜！（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"婚照。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994512628846592832514.png/zl42y5JQa2cctGvpJfvYMNnWxUMrfM-70RDy39EQ8t8\"/><figcaption>婚照。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"8月已叫「老公」。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994510292488192534671.png/cs-1NLyKoOQWRbMPEvkSdKuGzPgJedWe_nv_QP57_0A\"/><figcaption>8月已叫「老公」。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><p>收起性感出嫁　巨型金鏈遮事業線</p><p>范彩兒自2014年恢復自由身後主力內地發展，2016年轉型為健身教練時，更因不時在社交網展現豐滿上圍而引起網民關注。不過在人生大事上，她就選擇「封胸」收起性感。從她在IG限時動態分享的相片可見，她穿上短袖款式的白色婚紗，長髮放下包住膊頭；雖然婚紗採用深V剪裁，但胸前被金光璀璨的足金頸鏈與典雅珍珠鏈遮掩，加上雙手戴滿多對龍鳳鈪，金光閃閃，行頭十足。</p><figure><img alt=\"菁瑋、潘嘉德、《愛回家》二太蘇恩磁有份出席婚宴。（IG@luvincw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994697090404352740821.png/xG3T5WWeCovPcmoGGQmxhw1IJK7amFOgStqe6Eranug\"/><figcaption>菁瑋、潘嘉德、《愛回家》二太蘇恩磁有份出席婚宴。（IG@luvincw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"菁瑋、潘嘉德、《愛回家》二太蘇恩磁有份出席婚宴。（IG@luvincw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194003761090007040127345.png/Mz9BO9aBI-UGrOTBCxd_HDzwhtwQ2hbityIznLciM5w\"/><figcaption>菁瑋、潘嘉德、《愛回家》二太蘇恩磁有份出席婚宴。（IG@luvincw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"范彩兒收起性感。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994692363161600923841.png/28nQHYmECJZDadGAReGBFEvYKD69rLWWQWLiNUFi4jU\"/><figcaption>范彩兒收起性感。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"用巨型金鏈遮胸。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994689632538624732501.png/WYwCg45OPc_N7PCZ7qIDPlMsgJdt-QssWWbJJVlmySU\"/><figcaption>用巨型金鏈遮胸。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"婚宴好熱鬧。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994905236541440948152.png/S7rgqBzMolqp6yvlD_aLN7b1es8h6hE369cBm-vXAZs\"/><figcaption>婚宴好熱鬧。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"婚宴好熱鬧。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994907581288448150398.png/k6IwUt4F793wF9vMt2Ifve38wEmThaLYK72uwyu9rsM\"/><figcaption>婚宴好熱鬧。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"婚宴好熱鬧。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994909829566464108374.png/9n1sJsDUsYXhcA00Mw-wT0I4vv5Plvh-hKgCK4SoAis\"/><figcaption>婚宴好熱鬧。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"婚宴好熱鬧。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994912065261568795168.png/vCsVUrkSqD_Q5y34s5S4Jif8uuy8rIMyeUIcenlCHHo\"/><figcaption>婚宴好熱鬧。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"婚宴好熱鬧。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994914108018688845073.png/wn4M829FOU_pzwBIsDuSCKOze4RM1naF2ii4-toouPo\"/><figcaption>婚宴好熱鬧。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"婚宴好熱鬧。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994905853235200932501.png/EXh3mb2RIgctEB0B-j0VNJOzSDLrktdKLHmLZSx5i2U\"/><figcaption>婚宴好熱鬧。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"婚宴好熱鬧。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994908030210048450631.png/rFMnP6bPFjgtE96_H6iLBBAzQ7cen3SDhPKXfITyl3w\"/><figcaption>婚宴好熱鬧。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><p>敬茶感動爆喊　換金絲裙褂交杯</p><p>在斟茶儀式環節，新娘子Jenny難掩出嫁的激動情緒，忍不住用敬茶的紙杯遮面感動落淚，更自嘲「喊到額頭有皺紋」。其後，一對新人換上傳統中式婚服，Jenny在裙褂外披上一件極具氣派的金絲披褸，盡顯貴氣。兩人除了切五層結婚蛋糕，更在台上甜蜜合巹交杯，幸福指數爆燈。</p><figure><img alt=\"交杯。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994694699520000257931.png/TBW_mvNL9o-Aai2UK0h21JPpHGcJrWMvI9QnKyPUJys\"/><figcaption>交杯。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"切蛋糕。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193995143754027008043678.png/34LjmgcK8LKpPnG-vefmPXb8ajq4J3LJgmkJu4JpCbs\"/><figcaption>切蛋糕。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><p>搞笑自嘲「戀父癖」 老公老竇似兩兄弟</p><p>婚宴上還發生了一段小插曲，當Jenny看到戴住黑框眼鏡、外表老實穩重的老公與爸爸在台上傾偈時，發現兩人竟然極度「撞樣」！她隨即拍下照片並在IG發文開玩笑寫道：「好多人話我有戀父霹（癖），因為我老公同我老寶（竇）有幾分似🤣🤣🤣🤣」。場面溫馨又搞笑，足見一家人關係融洽。</p><figure><img alt=\"覺得老公同老竇有幾分相似。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193995341024727040451203.png/DbBGGwD7EQMhMlXfnS31CPmzbpwb6PfwuWkS2LlpEtg\"/><figcaption>覺得老公同老竇有幾分相似。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><p>入行多年星途平淡　轉型教練惹關注</p><p>其實范彩兒已入行多年，星途相對平淡。她畢業於2009年第23期無綫電視藝員訓練班，初期多演跑龍套或閒角；直至2010年，在處境劇《依家有喜》中飾演診所接待員「蘇哥莉」一角才稍為為人認識。2012年，她毅然轉投香港電視網絡（HKTV），並參演過神劇《警界線》。2014年恢復自由身後，她將事業重心移師內地；直到2016年12月，她以健身教練身份拍片示範時，因大騷豐滿上圍而再度成為網民熱話，成功轉型。</p><figure><img alt=\"范彩兒曾於TVB處境劇《依家有喜》飾演診所接待員「蘇哥莉（Cally）」，跟蘇恩慈同廖碧兒合作。（TVB擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193993978274385920681705.jpeg/XQIlq-_Fb-K54YAeswVewn4DUc0kwnLcVY2Np1WNjac\"/><figcaption>范彩兒曾於TVB處境劇《依家有喜》飾演診所接待員「蘇哥莉（Cally）」，跟蘇恩慈同廖碧兒合作。（TVB擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傲人身材。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994135737077760910786.jpeg/lYSw18daHsoRNRajDJBG2D0YQeAJJ6X9gTx9IYE8fSE\"/><figcaption>傲人身材。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"社交平台不乏性感照。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994332080705536360847.jpeg/ZJqD4CXsAk1MHot8x9e6RbiX5Khv_84LQ9lXMUPZVzE\"/><figcaption>社交平台不乏性感照。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"社交平台不乏性感照。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994334232514560712568.jpeg/MRdw2CTs0p-jejs88YA0Gw5Y-bVPIidTWO3W8ljt1vI\"/><figcaption>社交平台不乏性感照。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"社交平台不乏性感照。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994336258494464571690.jpeg/tP0XbMAoDLi53EsJlygduH78ui6Inld8JOHh7iTh4e4\"/><figcaption>社交平台不乏性感照。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"社交平台不乏性感照。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994338238337024189753.jpeg/3Iwq8xpMxpt5hLVEKKT8gQWmZGFq351km6jfmpuo35o\"/><figcaption>社交平台不乏性感照。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"社交平台不乏性感照。（IG@jennyfan1216）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193994340398534656458291.jpeg/-RzAUOOTY23Z3xHLBbt6QXGiTUIH47KIf4HfaH-B32g\"/><figcaption>社交平台不乏性感照。（IG@jennyfan1216）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T22:40:39.463581+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1562,"images":26,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T22:30:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T01:39:23.670984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T22:38:23.721755+00:00","content_hash":"62c35fe01d6ad593a3f4ddbc7529acb4d1ed9e92baa8925f9e1897b6ffeb8383","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}